WEBVTT

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:30.877
ismli personajlarni

00:01:30.877 --> 00:01:33.000
o'z ichiga olgan bu epik manzaradan

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:37.697
chuqur qoniqish his etasiz.

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:40.004
Bu oddiy tarixiy drama emas.

00:01:40.004 --> 00:01:43.407
"Yolg'izlikning yuz yili" 
sehrli realizm adabiy oqimining

00:01:43.407 --> 00:01:49.099
eng mashhur namunalaridan biridir.

00:01:49.099 --> 00:01:51.519
Unda g'ayritabiiy voqealar 
hamda qobiliyatlar

00:01:51.519 --> 00:01:55.104
go'yo hayotiydek tasvirlanadi,

00:01:55.104 --> 00:01:57.661
turmushimiz va tariximizdagi 
haqiqiy voqealar esa

00:01:57.661 --> 00:02:01.831
xayoliy bema'nilikka to'la 
holda aks etadi.